graph LR
  U[User<br/>Next.js Health Cases UI]
  U -->|POST /health-cases/intake| Intake[Intake Agent<br/>health_case_intake_agent<br/>Gemini Pro · confirm-before-save]
  Intake -->|confirmed profile| U
  U -->|upload PDF records| S3[(S3 encrypted<br/>case-scoped · not in Mongo profile)]
  U -->|POST /health-cases/:id/briefs| API[Flask API on AWS ECS]
  API -->|SSE stream + tool_result events| U
  API -->|Runner.run_async| Nav[SequentialAgent<br/>health_case_navigator]
  Nav --> Research[ParallelAgent<br/>Research stage · Gemini Flash]
  Research --> Evid[evidence_research_agent]
  Research --> Trial[clinical_trial_agent]
  Research --> Res[researcher_match_agent]
  Research --> Web[web_discourse_agent<br/>optional · Google Search grounding]
  Research --> Exa[exa_web_research_agent<br/>optional · HEALTH_CASE_ENABLE_EXA]
  Evid --> Tools[paper_search · evidence_lookup · guideline_lookup]
  Trial --> MCP[McpToolset · clinical_trials_lookup<br/>stdio synapse_mcp_server]
  Trial --> Inline[inline clinical_trials_lookup<br/>fallback when MCP unavailable]
  Res --> RM[researcher_match tool]
  Nav --> Topics[intervention_topics_agent<br/>Gemini Flash · citation-grounded]
  Topics --> Synth[health_case_brief_synthesis_agent<br/>Gemini Pro · topics verbatim]
  Tools --> OA[(OpenAlex corpus)]
  Tools --> KG[(Evidence / Knowledge graph)]
  RM --> RG[(Synapse researcher graph · Mongo)]
  Inline --> CT[(ClinicalTrials.gov<br/>synced registry)]
  MCP --> CT
  Web --> GoogleSearch[(Google Search)]
  Exa --> ExaAPI[(Exa API)]
  Synth --> Guard{Citation Guard<br/>verify_citations<br/>NCT + acronym check}
  Guard -->|guarded brief metadata| API
  Guard -.->|unverified refs| Banner[/References we could not verify banner/]
  Guard -.->|verify NCT IDs| CT
  API -.->|timeout / error before first token| Legacy[Legacy single-model research agent]
  API -.->|digest_enabled subscribe| Digest[health_case_digest cron<br/>delta vs prior brief sources]
  Digest --> CIO[Customer.io<br/>health_case_digest_ready]
  CIO -.->|weekly email| U
  API -.->|feed_suggestion| Feed[Launch Research Agent Feed]
